#: ../folio-assistant-core/collab/processes/content/content-lifecycle.bpmn:161
#. Diagram label
msgid "Open the bean"
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/collab/processes/content/content-lifecycle.bpmn:47
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Opens and closes the cycle rather than running any of it: Task_Plan commits scope, team and artefacts before Lane_WorkPlan turns them into beans, and Task_Retire is reached only when Gateway_NextCycle finds nothing left to do."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/collab/processes/content/content-lifecycle.bpmn:80
#. Diagram label
msgid "Plan scope, team, artifacts"
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/collab/processes/content/content-lifecycle.bpmn:178
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Process_BeanClose: end the bean in a state that says why — complete and archive it, scrap it with its reasons and archive it, or record the blocker and hand it back. The one place resolve and archive are drawn; placed straight before the end so the engine's resolve sees nothing left but the archive step."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/collab/processes/content/content-lifecycle.bpmn:162
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Process_BeanOpen: check before you create, find out whose the bean is, and claim it — or leave it alone when it is someone else's. The one place a claim is drawn; the gateway after this reads which end it reached."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/collab/processes/content/content-lifecycle.bpmn:46
#. Diagram label
msgid "Programme manager"
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/collab/processes/content/content-lifecycle.bpmn:72
#. Diagram label
msgid "Publication manager"
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/collab/processes/content/content-lifecycle.bpmn:168
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Reads which end Process_BeanOpen reached. `claimed`: the bean is in progress and this process works it. `not yours`: a sibling session or a human holds it, nothing was written to it, and this process stops here rather than work a bean it does not own (bean-coordination)."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/collab/processes/content/content-lifecycle.bpmn:150
#. Diagram label
msgid "Retire or archive"
msgstr ""

