msgid "Review team and SMEs"
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/collab/processes/content/content-lifecycle.bpmn:81
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Scope the work, identify artifacts and actors, form the team, set the timeline."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/collab/processes/content/content-lifecycle.bpmn:115
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "See draft-to-publication.bpmn."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/collab/processes/content/content-lifecycle.bpmn:96
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "See editing-hci-validation.bpmn. Runs once per proposed change, not once per cycle."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/collab/processes/content/content-lifecycle.bpmn:88
#. Diagram label
msgid "Seed the work plan"
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/collab/processes/content/content-lifecycle.bpmn:174
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Someone else holds the bean; this run stops without touching it."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/collab/processes/content/content-lifecycle.bpmn:65
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "The corpus-wide check no single block's HCI validation gate can perform — cross-references, whole-folio build status, proof status and QA axes — between the editor's accept and the publication manager's release: a change that passed block-level review still has to clear folio-level checks before CallActivity_Publication runs."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/collab/processes/content/content-lifecycle.bpmn:69
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "The only reviewing this lane does happens AFTER publication, not before it: Task_Feedback triages what implementers and readers report on the LIVE folio, by severity and scope, and Task_FeedbackBeans turns that triage into the next cycle's work."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/collab/processes/content/content-lifecycle.bpmn:56
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "The re-entry point for every round of the cycle: Gateway_NextCycle's 'yes' branch loops back here, not to Task_Plan. Runs once per proposed change, and makes the accept decision on each before the corpus-wide Task_Test."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/collab/processes/content/content-lifecycle.bpmn:73
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "The single point in the cycle where the corpus becomes public, reached only after Task_Test has cleared the whole folio; draft-to-publication.bpmn is the last gate before readers see anything."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/collab/processes/content/content-lifecycle.bpmn:123
#. Diagram label
msgid "Triage published feedback"
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/collab/processes/content/content-lifecycle.bpmn:132
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Triaged feedback re-enters the work plan as beans, which is how the next cycle knows what it is for."
msgstr ""

